10-27 11:56:33','2026-04-01 17:18:48','live_scrape',0),(900582,'Vidify','TankMatez','United States',5,'This app is so amazing! I\'m glad I decided to give it a go. The team is also great to work with, and I get the sense that they truly care about their customers.','2022-11-03','Organic',0,'2025-10-27 11:56:33','2026-04-01 17:10:04','live_scrape',1),(900583,'Vidify','The Bullish Store','United States',5,'I\'ve installed this app on two stores and it\'s a super affordable and simple way to auto-post products to social media. The team has been responsive to issues, and it looks like more features (such as the ability to exclude certain products from autoposting) are in development. It would also be nice to be able to reorder a queue of future autoposts instead of having it be truly random. One limitation of this type of thing is that Facebook posts that are obviously selling something don\'t get shown to many people due to the Facebook algorithm, but that\'s not really something the app can help. The convenience is certainly worth the current price of this app.','2022-10-01','Organic',0,'2025-10-27 11:56:33','2026-04-01 17:10:10','live_scrape',1),(900584,'Vidify','TicoDescuentos','United States',5,'I\'ve been using this app for a few months now and I have to say, it\'s been a game changer for my business. Not only has it saved me so much time by automatically responding to comments on both Instagram and Facebook, but the support team is truly amazing. They are always quick to respond and have helped me customize my auto responses to fit my brand voice perfectly.','2023-05-06',NULL,0,'2025-10-27 12:24:42','2025-10-31 09:00:37','live_scrape',0),(900585,'Vidify','Boutique by Zandra ~ $5 Jewelry & Accessories','United States',5,'Love the IG comment selling, tagging is no longer an issue. Just comment to purchase and check out.','2022-05-19',NULL,0,'2025-10-27 12:24:42','2025-10-31 09:00:37','live_scrape',0),(902667,'TrustSync','Heights Jewelers','United States',5,'Ashikar is phenominal. He is patient, cooperative and most heopful to this inexperienced user. Kudos for having himon your team','2025-10-28','Ashik',0,'2025-10-29 10:34:21','2025-10-31 09:29:52','live_scrape',1),(902668,'TrustSync','Paramount Scents','United States',5,'I have no complaints!  It was easy and set up and very straightforward.  An amazing experience.','2025-10-28','Vinz',0,'2025-10-29 12:32:57','2025-10-31 09:29:47','live_scrape',1),(903196,'StoreFAQ','Crest','South Africa',5,'Tracy from Storeware has been very helpful. There were changes I needed to make and she has guided me step by step with very clear guidance. The StoreFAQ builder works very well and with the help of Tracy it has been a smooth and easy process. Thank you so much Tracy!','2025-10-28','Zeba',0,'2025-10-30 13:08:29','2025-10-31 09:27:00','live_scrape',1),(903197,'StoreFAQ','PK Automaten GmbH','Germany',5,'Santos solved a problem for me in just a few minutes that I had been trying to solve myself for hours. Now the FAQs are neatly integrated into our website and we can refer our customers to them. Great!','2025-10-24','Amin',0,'2025-10-30 13:08:29','2025-10-31 09:27:04','live_scrape',1),(903198,'StoreFAQ','Moore Notary Service','United States',5,'This app perfectly displays my FAQ\'s in a clean and simple format that is easy to read and navigate. No extra unnecessary gimmicks, just a simple and easy to use FAQ app.','2025-10-22','Vinz',0,'2025-10-30 13:08:29','2025-10-31 09:27:17','live_scrape',1),(903199,'StoreFAQ','HealthyWealthyKids','United States',5,'The support team is very helpful and nice. They were able to assist me on the design FAQ adjustments esp. Martha. I love the design features and it\'s easy to use','2025-10-21','Vinz',0,'2025-10-30 13:08:29','2025-10-31 09:27:29','live_scrape',1),(903200,'StoreFAQ','AquaVanta pro','United States',5,'Great app and the support is top notch','2025-09-28','Vinz',0,'2025-10-30 13:08:29','2025-11-06 08:33:15','live_scrape',1),(903201,'StoreFAQ','