low','joyfulcakes.ae','Unknown',5,'Good','2026-04-01',NULL,0,'2026-04-05 12:12:36','2026-04-05 12:12:36','live_scrape',1),(906178,'EasyFlow','Cassandra Mamone','Australia',5,'','2026-03-31',NULL,0,'2026-04-05 12:12:36','2026-04-05 12:12:36','live_scrape',1),(906179,'StoreSEO','The Acorn Gallery','United States',5,'We have used StoreSEO for a few years now and we trust it more than several others we tried first. It is much better laid out and easier to understand what you need to change. If you get stuck the staff are right there to help on Chat!','2026-04-10',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31','live_scrape',1),(906180,'StoreSEO','The Healthy Home Shop','United States',5,'I\'m really impressed with StoreSEO. The AI-driven blog and image optimization make SEO much more streamlined and effective. I\'ve noticed better structure and an overall improvement in our content strategy.','2026-04-15',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31','live_scrape',1),(906181,'StoreSEO','Odyssey Teams','United States',5,'Migrating Odyssey Teams from WordPress to Shopify was one of the best operational decisions we’ve made. Shopify gave us a clean, modern, high‑performing website and a centralized system that finally brings our storefront, payments, analytics, and customer experience into one place. The platform is fast, intuitive, and built for scale. Checkout is noticeably smoother for our customers, and the built‑in analytics give us real‑time insights we never had before. Managing products, programs, and content is dramatically easier, no more plugin chaos or maintenance headaches. We also love how flexible Shopify is. The theme tools let us create a site that truly reflects our brand, and the app ecosystem gives us room to grow without custom development every time we need a new feature. If you’re a business looking for reliability, speed, and a platform that actually supports your growth, Shopify delivers. It’s been a transformative upgrade for us.','2026-04-24',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31','live_scrape',1),(906182,'StoreSEO','ExcellentSupply.com','United States',5,'Great SEO app that covers the full gamut of SEO from A-Z, including AI Snippets – for Chat GPT, etc. Their new Keyword Cluster feature is cool too. They\'ve really thought it all out. Also the support is wonderful. Did an onboarding session with them where all my questions were answered and it provided a deep dive into how to get the most out of Store-SEO. Its automatic AI generation can be excessive, so you\'ll want to keep an eye on that. Overall though, this is a power tool for user-friendly management of SEO!','2026-04-16',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31','live_scrape',1),(906183,'StoreSEO','Old Resaca Mercantile','United States',5,'I love this app, especially the AI features. It is well worth the money and the support is great on this app as well!','2026-04-07',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31','live_scrape',1),(906184,'StoreSEO','mes-accessoireauto','France',5,'m\'a fait gagner un temps fou','2026-04-26',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:36','2026-04-27 11:10:36','live_scrape',1),(906185,'StoreSEO','Lumo Bloc Lamps','New Zealand',5,'Very easy to onboard and improvements are suggested immediately','2026-04-26',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:36','2026-04-27 11:10:36','live_scrape',1),(906186,'StoreSEO','Blackmer KI Pumps Store','United States',5,'I’m really impressed with the new Agentic Discovery Score tools. They streamline the entire process and make it much easier than anything from the competition.','2026-04-24',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:36','2026-04-27 11:10:36','live_scrape',1),(906187,'StoreSEO','BENTIX','United Kingdom',5,'Jen was a great help and i really appriciate her for sorting my shopify store out in like 15mins.','2026-04-23',NULL,0,'2026-04-27 11:10:36','2026-04-27 11:10:36','live_scrape',1),(906188,'StoreSEO','Online Creators Club - Marketingbasen - CVR: 36003480','Denmark',5,'What a dedicated s