INSERT INTO `access_reviews` VALUES (9026,'EasyFlow','2025-10-26','','Canada',5,NULL,NULL,900170,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9027,'EasyFlow','2025-10-20','Phenomenal customer service! The app is intuitive and easy to use.','United States',5,NULL,NULL,900171,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9028,'EasyFlow','2025-10-17','','United States',5,NULL,NULL,900172,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9029,'EasyFlow','2025-10-15','Very good application , easy to use and it has an amazing support','United States',5,NULL,NULL,900173,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9030,'EasyFlow','2025-10-13','he was great and helpful . we figured out my issues','United States',5,NULL,NULL,900174,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9031,'EasyFlow','2025-10-05','','Italy',5,NULL,NULL,900175,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9032,'EasyFlow','2025-09-30','Not only is the app great - But the support is even better! This implimentation and options available are top notch!','United States',5,NULL,NULL,900176,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9053,'TrustSync','2025-10-28','Ashikar is phenominal. He is patient, cooperative and most heopful to this inexperienced user. Kudos for having himon your team','United States',5,NULL,NULL,902667,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9054,'TrustSync','2025-10-22','Bis auf den ersten Blick zufrieden.','Switzerland',5,NULL,NULL,900490,'2025-10-29 12:22:06','2025-10-29 12:22:06'),(9055,'TrustSync','2025-10-28','I have no complaints!  It was easy and set up and very straightforward.  An amazing experience.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,902668,'2025-10-29 12:32:57','2025-10-29 12:32:57'),(9056,'StoreSEO','2025-11-01','customer service at your fingertips, instantly able to help and work out the issue for me.  Love this App simple to use and very effective','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905940,'2025-11-03 12:44:23','2025-11-03 12:44:23'),(9057,'StoreFAQ','2025-11-02','Ever since I gave these people access to my store to fix what should’ve  been an easy thing which was copying and paste the link they provided to hide their brand my site been out of wack! Be careful giving them access. Good thing I had duplicated my store before hand. Also with their \"Free Plan\" you get 100 FAQ views a month so even when you’re just starting and trying to figure the app out (which was challenging for me) and even when they helped me (which they also have to view your page) those count as 100 views which makes no sense to me.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905941,'2025-11-03 12:46:45','2025-11-03 12:46:45'),(9058,'TrustSync','2025-11-02','Ashikur assisted me in checking keyword SEO. He was very helpful.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905946,'2025-11-05 05:53:22','2025-11-05 05:53:22'),(9059,'StoreSEO','2025-11-06','I always have such a hard tune with technology,  but Jenn from Storeseo made sure to walk me through everything patiently as the expert that she is. This was the first time that I have ever gotten 100 on my SEO.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905947,'2025-11-09 07:17:11','2025-11-09 07:17:11'),(9060,'StoreSEO','2025-10-21','Really helpful app! It makes SEO optimization so much easier and faster. I noticed improvements in my store ranking within a few days. The setup was simple, and the support team is very responsive. Highly recommend it for anyone serious about boosting visibility!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905948,'2025-11-09 07:17:11','2025-11-09 07:17:11'),(9061,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2025-11-05','Loren was quick, professional, and incredibly helpful. Great communication and support — Thank you!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905949,'2025-11-09 07:17:18','2025-11-09 07:17:18'),(9062,'StoreSEO','2025-11-13','Jen helped me and resolved all my concerns today. The star rating is for her. The app itself works overall, and I want to keep using it but has some hesitation because the instructions and pricing structure are very confusing. I have some feedbacks I want to bring up to attention:','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905957,'2025-11-16 04:27:55','2025-11-16 04:27:55'),(9063,'StoreFAQ','2025-11-14','Customer service was incredible as I was setting things up. I love the product. It looks great on my pages and was easy to work with. I especially love the FAQ schema.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905961,'2025-11-16 04:28:02','2025-11-16 04:28:02'),(9064,'TrustSync','2025-11-20','If you are looking for a simple, automated way to boost your social proof and get more reviews, this is the app to use. It\'s not just about the star rating; it genuinely helps improve our SEO and traffic from customer reviews. Their customer service has also been excellent.\"','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905977,'2025-11-23 06:07:50','2025-11-23 06:07:50'),(9065,'Vidify','2025-11-25','Tried the \"3 for free\" intro offer. \nEasy to do, but hard to find in Shopify once completed - thought you were asking me to upgrade to paid version! \nLooks cool though.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905986,'2025-11-26 10:25:58','2025-11-26 10:25:58'),(9066,'StoreSEO','2025-11-30','I can’t thank Loren enough! She went above and beyond to help me and made everything easy to understand. Her patience, kindness, and professionalism truly impressed me. Thanks to her guidance, I got my SEO score from 40 to 100, which is unbelievable! Loren, you are amazing — thank you for turning a stressful situation into such a positive and successful experience!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,905992,'2025-12-01 07:18:21','2025-12-01 07:18:21'),(9067,'Vidify','2025-12-01','I cannot be happier. I just installed this app and so far, it is exactly what I was looking for. The app is very user friendly and the support is top-notch.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906001,'2025-12-07 07:43:36','2025-12-07 07:43:36'),(9068,'TrustSync','2025-12-09','Rated five Stars','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906009,'2025-12-10 05:53:46','2025-12-10 05:53:46'),(9069,'Vidify','2025-12-15','I’ve had this app installed for less than 15 minutes and most of that time has been spent waiting while a video sits stuck on “Starting.” There’s no clear feedback, no progress indicator, and you have to scroll horizontally just to even see that something might be happening. That alone makes the experience feel clunky and not user friendly.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906018,'2025-12-17 05:12:07','2025-12-17 05:12:07'),(9070,'Vidify','2025-12-24','does not allow video generation or allow contact for support','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906020,'2025-12-30 05:49:12','2025-12-30 05:49:12'),(9071,'StoreFAQ','2026-01-02','I am setting this up and had a question. The support was amazing and the app is very straight forward. Highly recommend!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906027,'2026-01-06 11:26:21','2026-01-06 11:26:21'),(9072,'StoreFAQ','2026-01-05','Great support! and the FAQ does everything we are looking for it to do so far.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906036,'2026-01-13 06:04:40','2026-01-13 06:04:40'),(9073,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2026-01-11','Wonderful app, gives an ontime response to request and resolve issues quickly. I am very satisfied with the results from using this app. Recommend for personal and professional use.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906039,'2026-01-13 06:04:59','2026-01-13 06:04:59'),(9074,'EasyFlow','2026-01-15','I had so many questions when onboarding this app - there are so many possibilities and calibrations and I wanted to do it right. Nicole was with me every step of the way and walked me through each step with incredible detail and patience. She walked me through each step with a video tutorial and took a hands on approach to making sure my storefront was ready for success - even finding ways to optimize that I hadn\'t yet seen or tackled. A 10/10 experience with Easy Flow thus far.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906049,'2026-01-20 04:46:23','2026-01-20 04:46:23'),(9075,'TrustSync','2026-01-28','Rep was very good, listened to my concern.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906055,'2026-02-01 05:53:47','2026-02-01 05:53:47'),(9076,'StoreSEO','2026-01-26','Like having a very smart big brother or sister! Very easy to use and understand. Very insightful when describing issues that I don\'t understand making it very to clear to work with. I don\'t know what I would do without the Store SEO assistant. Great work keep it up!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906056,'2026-02-01 05:55:15','2026-02-01 05:55:15'),(9077,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2026-01-28','I had a call with Invinzor to get familiar with the app. He was very helpful, I now have a path to get started with Better Docs. Looks like it will be a good app for what we need.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906058,'2026-02-01 05:55:33','2026-02-01 05:55:33'),(9078,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2026-02-05','BetterDocs is a great app! It helped us build our health knowledge base seamlessly. Also, must say the customer support is super helpful! They respond within seconds and resolve our queries promptly.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906063,'2026-02-08 05:38:09','2026-02-08 05:38:09'),(9079,'TrustSync','2026-02-12','Application facile à configurer. Plan gratuit suffisament complet pour une petite structure. Service client dispo, agréable et très réactif !','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906073,'2026-02-16 05:22:52','2026-02-16 05:22:52'),(9080,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2026-02-13','I needed to set up a knowledge base or a Wiki and this app is the best one I found for my usecase. The design part of the app is a bit lacking on features, but this is very well covered by the support team. If you\'re having any problems just reach out to support!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906074,'2026-02-16 05:27:08','2026-02-16 05:27:08'),(9081,'EasyFlow','2026-02-09','This is fantastic, the customer service i received from Nicole was second to none. I really appreciate the prompt and reliable service i received after my inquiry. As for the app it works great i run a 3d printing business and so we have lots of addons and extras to offer and this app makes our site look and operate really professionally.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906075,'2026-02-16 05:43:28','2026-02-16 05:43:28'),(9082,'EasyFlow','2026-02-11','Jen was fantastic and was able to help me get my products set up exactly how I wanted even with my custom website design. So nice to have the option to use options instead of variants where needed for my products and they have an actual \"free\" plan that meets my needs and not a sneaky \"free\" plan that isn\'t actually free in the long run. Thanks Jen!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906076,'2026-02-16 05:43:28','2026-02-16 05:43:28'),(9083,'Vidify','2026-02-17','The Vidify team have been very helpful in assisting me getting my images made. This is a team willing to help when you reach out to them.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906086,'2026-02-19 03:33:31','2026-02-19 03:33:31'),(9084,'StoreSEO','2026-02-19','Its a fantastic hands on app to achieve SEO Optimisation for our website and products. The AI feature makes it extremely easy for best results. With Store seo you dont need to hire any costly assistants for SEO optimisation.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906087,'2026-02-22 03:02:04','2026-02-22 03:02:04'),(9085,'TrustSync','2026-02-19','Thank you to Tracy, for taking the time to answer all of my questions. You were wonderful to deal with.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906091,'2026-02-22 03:03:19','2026-02-22 03:03:19'),(9086,'StoreSEO','2026-02-24','I needed assistance with using StoreSEO, I was like a fish out of water. Invinzor Sagcilo walked me through the full process. When I started I had a score of 68, he helped me bring my score to 100%. Now, that I have the knowledge I can now work on updated my SEOs on my own.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906103,'2026-02-28 12:54:55','2026-02-28 12:54:55'),(9087,'StoreSEO','2026-02-25','I was charged $68 dollars for No reason with this app , I need to speak with someone , how is this possible. I want back my money','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906104,'2026-02-28 12:54:55','2026-02-28 12:54:55'),(9088,'StoreFAQ','2026-02-26','This app is very easy to use and the free option makes it easy to start for small stores.  Support is also really good for questions.  Very happy.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906111,'2026-02-28 12:55:39','2026-02-28 12:55:39'),(9089,'StoreFAQ','2026-02-26','Incredible kind and fast support. Being not a \'techy person\', their support team helped me set it patiently and therefore would highly recommend it.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906112,'2026-02-28 12:55:39','2026-02-28 12:55:39'),(9090,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2026-03-02','After encountering a problem with the editor\'s display, I contacted support via the conversation tool. We were able to narrow down and resolve the issue in several steps. The tool that allowed support direct access to my installation was extremely helpful. This is what I call good support!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906120,'2026-03-03 04:46:35','2026-03-03 04:46:35'),(9091,'StoreSEO','2026-03-17','He explained everything perfectly to me. He took his time and went step by step. I was able to follow along and now I am completely confident that I can manage this app with the knowledge that he has provided me.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906146,'2026-03-20 05:43:23','2026-03-20 05:43:23'),(9092,'EasyFlow','2026-03-20','Quiero dejar una merecida reseña de 5 estrellas para EasyFlow. Martha y Nicole ofrecieron un apoyo excepcional: profesional, paciente y amable durante todo el proceso. Había intentado muchas veces resolver mi problema por mi cuenta y estaba a punto de rendirme, pero ellos nunca se rindieron conmigo. Nicole encontró rápidamente la solución, y la paciencia de Martha fue sobresombrosa. ¡Muchas gracias a los dos! Recomiendo mucho esta app y su equipo de soporte.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906153,'2026-03-21 09:21:36','2026-03-21 09:21:36'),(9093,'StoreFAQ','2026-03-25','Invinzor and Martha were very helpful with setting up and troubleshooting some initial issues.  Very responsive and knowledgeable.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906167,'2026-03-29 06:01:57','2026-03-29 06:01:57'),(9094,'EasyFlow','2026-03-27','We were struggling to create a bundled product as we needed it to manage inventory. We had a scheduled call with Amit who was very patient and helped us find a solution. Many thanks','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906168,'2026-03-29 06:02:02','2026-03-29 06:02:02'),(9095,'BetterDocs FAQ Knowledge Base','2026-03-18','exceptional service and a great product. Looking forward to building my database and connecting with the world through betterdocs. Thanks yall!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906169,'2026-03-29 06:02:11','2026-03-29 06:02:11'),(9096,'StoreSEO','2026-04-10','We have used StoreSEO for a few years now and we trust it more than several others we tried first. It is much better laid out and easier to understand what you need to change. If you get stuck the staff are right there to help on Chat!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906179,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31'),(9097,'StoreSEO','2026-04-15','I\'m really impressed with StoreSEO. The AI-driven blog and image optimization make SEO much more streamlined and effective. I\'ve noticed better structure and an overall improvement in our content strategy.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906180,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31'),(9098,'StoreSEO','2026-04-24','Migrating Odyssey Teams from WordPress to Shopify was one of the best operational decisions we’ve made. Shopify gave us a clean, modern, high‑performing website and a centralized system that finally brings our storefront, payments, analytics, and customer experience into one place. The platform is fast, intuitive, and built for scale. Checkout is noticeably smoother for our customers, and the built‑in analytics give us real‑time insights we never had before. Managing products, programs, and content is dramatically easier, no more plugin chaos or maintenance headaches. We also love how flexible Shopify is. The theme tools let us create a site that truly reflects our brand, and the app ecosystem gives us room to grow without custom development every time we need a new feature. If you’re a business looking for reliability, speed, and a platform that actually supports your growth, Shopify delivers. It’s been a transformative upgrade for us.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906181,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31'),(9099,'StoreSEO','2026-04-16','Great SEO app that covers the full gamut of SEO from A-Z, including AI Snippets – for Chat GPT, etc. Their new Keyword Cluster feature is cool too. They\'ve really thought it all out. Also the support is wonderful. Did an onboarding session with them where all my questions were answered and it provided a deep dive into how to get the most out of Store-SEO. Its automatic AI generation can be excessive, so you\'ll want to keep an eye on that. Overall though, this is a power tool for user-friendly management of SEO!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906182,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31'),(9100,'StoreSEO','2026-04-07','I love this app, especially the AI features. It is well worth the money and the support is great on this app as well!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906183,'2026-04-27 11:10:31','2026-04-27 11:10:31'),(9101,'StoreFAQ','2026-04-16','Great product and very good customer service. Quick to respond.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906193,'2026-04-27 11:10:47','2026-04-27 11:10:47'),(9102,'StoreFAQ','2026-04-21','The StoreFAQ Staff are always very kind and helpful since the beginning. With their help we will be using this app more efficiently.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906194,'2026-04-27 11:10:47','2026-04-27 11:10:47'),(9103,'StoreFAQ','2026-04-30','This is a really nice app that does everything that I need it to. My support question about a small feature tweak was solved the same day. It was already there and they guided me right to it. After trying quite a few FAQs, this one rose above them all.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906207,'2026-05-04 06:24:12','2026-05-04 06:24:12'),(9104,'EasyFlow','2026-04-22','This app makes setting up products with multiple variants easy! The customization for the many display styles are great. The whole app is extremely user-friendly. Customers will find our product pages with multiple variants and variant selection options a breeze to navigate.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906208,'2026-05-04 06:24:39','2026-05-04 06:24:39'),(9105,'EasyFlow','2026-04-14','Needed help and Amit called and resolved all my problems with expertise and was patient with me whilst I followed his instructions,\nThanks\nwould highly recommend EasyFlow','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906209,'2026-05-04 06:24:39','2026-05-04 06:24:39'),(9106,'EasyFlow','2026-04-30','Amazing support. Fixed the problem within minutes. Thank you for your support!','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906210,'2026-05-04 06:24:39','2026-05-04 06:24:39'),(9107,'EasyFlow','2026-04-06','I tried a 3 or 4 other similar apps before this, and I found this one worked out of the box and looked best on mobile and desktop. Very helpful for my variants and addons.','United States',NULL,NULL,NULL,906211,'2026-05-04 06:24:39','2026-05-04 06:24:39');
